As parents, it is essential that we understand negative emotions to know that they are necessary to move forward in life. Negative emotions are not bad at all and it is important to teach children to understand that all emotions, those considered good and those considered bad, are necessary in life.
Children must be taught to understand that sadness, rage, anger, anger ... are natural emotions and it is normal to feel them. Only that we must learn to manage those emotions without them managing us.
