CNC Machining: The prototype is mainly produced by a cutting center. Referring to the product design drawing, the redundant material is removed from the solid plastic blank by cutting tool on the cutting machine tool, and the parts conforming to the size and shape are obtained.
---Material: PU resin is generally used, but also can provide a variety of simulation materials.
