Multi layer handling of goods: interlaced scanning of paper products and textiles that need to be moisture-proof and moisture-proof, covering one or more layers. Stretching or shrinking film wrapped items will increase the support for angle steel and cover bulkheads and other reinforcement structures.
Facilities: pay more attention to whether the pallet can be used with the forklift; At the same time, Hercules hegerls storage shelf manufacturer reminds everyone that when operating a forklift or manual hydraulic vehicle, the fork stab should be as close as possible to the outside of the fork hole of the pallet. The forks should be fully extended into the tray, and the angle can be changed only after the tray is lifted smoothly.
Goods placement: remember not to overload the goods, and pay attention to the standard placement of the goods on the pallet, so as to avoid the goods falling off when they are on the shelf; Load of goods: the load of goods on the pallet shall be uniform.
Warehouse floor management: the warehouse floor shall be clean and tidy, and there shall be no acid-base substances, of course, there shall be no oil stains, otherwise the service life of the pallet will be reduced;
Stacking of goods: when pallets are placed on the shelves, they must not be piled too high or too heavy. There should be a space of not less than 100mm between the bottom shelf pallet and the upper plate;
Goods packaging: wooden, paper and metal containers and other rigid rigid direct goods shall be stacked in single or multiple layers, and shall be packed with stretch or shrink film. Reinforcement and protection: fixation of pallet bearing goods.
