What are the main factors affecting the service life of warehouse shelves?
With the development of social economy, the continuous improvement of people’s needs, and the continuous expansion of enterprise users, storage shelves have become the most indispensable storage equipment in people’s lives. Of course, for the use of storage shelves, people’s greater concern is: storage shelves are based on comprehensive storage equipment such as packaging, transportation, loading and unloading, sorting, and information management.
Cargo weight: During the use of warehouse shelves, do not put goods that exceed the load-bearing limit of the shelves to prevent the shelves from deforming and causing accidents;
Transportation conditions and packaging materials: During the transportation of warehouse shelves, if there is a strong impact and vibration, it will also affect the service life of the storage shelves. At the same time, the packaging of the shelves is also exquisite, so in terms of packaging materials and packaging methods, Use good quality ones.
Maintenance: Maintenance of warehouse shelves should be done at ordinary times, and protective paint should be applied regularly to reduce the occurrence of rust; of course, daily inspection should be done to check whether the screws are loose. If found, it should be tightened and repaired in time.
The above is the arrangement of the main factors affecting the service life of warehouse shelves by Hebei Higerls HGERLS storage shelves. I hope it will be helpful to major enterprise users who use storage warehouse shelves.
