The rear equipment of the factory, such as metal cutting machine tools (including turning, milling, planing, inserting and other equipment), if the parts of the equipment needed for production are broken and need to be repaired, it needs to be sent to the machining workshop for repair or processing. In order to ensure the smooth progress of production, general enterprises are equipped with machining workshops, mainly responsible for the maintenance of production equipment.
All the operators engaged in various kinds of machinery must be trained in safety technology and pass the examination before they can start work.
The tool, clamp, cutter and workpiece must be firmly clamped. All kinds of machine tools should be idled at low speed after starting up, and can be formally operated only after everything is normal.
Tools and other things are prohibited on the track surface and working table of the machine tool. Do not use hands to remove iron filings, should use special tools to clean.
Observe the dynamics around the machine before starting the machine. After starting the machine, stand in a safe position to avoid the moving parts of the
In the operation of all kinds of machine tools, it is forbidden to adjust the variable speed mechanism or stroke, touch the transmission part, moving workpiece, cutting tool and other working surfaces in processing, measure any size in operation, and transfer or take tools and other objects across the transmission part of machine tools.
When abnormal noise is found, the machine should be stopped for maintenance immediately. It is not allowed to operate forcibly or with illness, and the machine is not allowed to use overload.
During the processing of each machine part, strictly implement the process discipline, see the drawings clearly, see the control points of each part, roughness and technical requirements of relevant parts, and determine the processing procedure of the production part.
