Haven; Home, Safe acknowledges Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples as the Traditional Custodians of the land and acknowledges and pays respect to their Elders, past, present and emerging.
We are not The Haven Foundation which provides accommodation and daily living support for socially and financially disadvantaged individuals living with mental illness.
We are a for-purpose organisation. We are a homelessness services agency that provides a range of housing solutions and wrap-around supports to help people find and keep a place they can call home.
Our goal is to prevent homelessness in Victoria.
In a world where homelessness and housing crisis exist, we connect people with housing options and integrated supports so that they can find and keep a place to call home.
