After a wet Winter and Spring rains on the way, now’s a great time to tackle some tasks outside, like cleaning your outdoor grates and drains.Outdoor drains are susceptible to clogging with leaves, stones or mud. If your drains are blocked it can result in unnecessary flooding and water damage at your property.
Lift the grate; if there’s debris in the drain, carefully remove it without damaging the pipe.
If you think your drain is still blocked or may be damaged, submit a maintenance request to Maintenance Service Team on 1300 100 242.
