Trusting Jesus means we are restored to God, which is amazing news because we were made to enjoy God.
We love watching sports, and great performers because we enjoy greatness.
Life means he gets to serve Jesus and death means he gets to be with Jesus – and there’s nowhere he’d rather be (Philippians 1:23).
The truth is, it’s better to be dirt poor in the presence of Jesus than to be filthy rich in the presence of men.
We will never be able to say to die is gain, until we really love Jesus.
